OL,3,CFirefighters believe blaze at Lake
OL,4,CDistrict beauty spot was caused by BBQ
OL,6,FFirefighters believe a blaze which
OL,7,Fbroke out at a Lake District beauty
OL,8,Fspot on Friday evening (14 August) was
OL,9,Fcaused by a BBQ.
OL,11,FCrews were called to Surprise View in
OL,12,FBorrowdale at 8.42pm, following
OL,13,Freports of a disposable BBQ "being
OL,14,Fdiscarded over the edge of a
OL,15,Fviewpoint".
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/4
