OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786808882
OL,3,CFirefighters believe blaze at Lake
OL,4,CDistrict beauty spot was caused by BBQ
OL,6,FThis was less than two hours after
OL,7,Fmillions of mobile phones across
OL,8,FEngland and Wales were sent an alert
OL,9,Ffrom the government warning of the
OL,10,Fdangers of wildfires, and urging
OL,11,Fpeople to not do anything that could
OL,12,Fstart a fire.
OL,14,FIn a post on Facebook, crews from
OL,15,FKeswick Fire Station have said they,
OL,16,Falong with colleagues from Ambleside,
OL,17,Fspent around three hours using
OL,18,Fspecialist wildfire equipment to
OL,19,Fextinguish the blaze.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/4
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
