CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786808882
OL,3,CFirefighters believe blaze at Lake
OL,4,CDistrict beauty spot was caused by BBQ
OL,6,FThey added that it was their fourth
OL,7,Fcallout of the evening and had the
OL,8,Fpotential to develop into a "much
OL,9,Flarger incident".
OL,11,FMeanwhile, some firefighters from
OL,12,FCumbria have been deployed to South
OL,13,FWales to help with a major wildfire
OL,14,Fresponse there.
OL,16,FThey said they have "seen first-hand
OL,17,Fthe devastation wildfires can cause".
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/4
