OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1786808882
OL,3,CFirefighters believe blaze at Lake
OL,4,CDistrict beauty spot was caused by BBQ
OL,6,FThe crews have urged people who may
OL,7,Fhave bought disposable barbecues
OL,8,Fbefore the temporary ban on their sale
OL,9,Fcame into force not to use them, to
OL,10,Favoid similar scenes in Cumbria.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/4
